  "summary": "CSRF protection bypass via _method override in github.com/mikehelmick/go-bananas",
  "details": "middleware.MutateMethod accepts a _method override from the query string or request body and allows overriding the HTTP method to safe methods such as GET. When installed as router middleware ahead of middleware.HandleCSRF, a cross-site POST request with _method=GET is routed to the POST handler while HandleCSRF observes a GET request and skips CSRF token validation.",
